## Run the app

Fill in the blank values in `.env`. Keep this file private. Run `__PM__ run db:migrate`, then `__PM__ run dev`.

Open http://localhost:3000, create an account, and visit `/dashboard`. Email/password authentication does not send email or implement password resets. Authentication uses PostgreSQL through Drizzle. SQL migrations are in `drizzle/`.

## Database changes

Edit `src/db/schema.ts`, run `__PM__ run db:generate`, then `__PM__ run db:migrate`. Do not run these migrations against a database whose existing tables conflict with the generated authentication tables.

